  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "# Issue:\n\nI often times find my self in the position of not knowing what category to give a canny on the Open Beta board.\n\nCurrently we only have two categories, \"Feature Requests\" and \"Bug Reports\". I often times just want to give a tiny bit of feedback to something that (in my opinion) doesn't count as a bug report and is neither big enough to count as a Feature Request.\n\n# Suggestion:\n\nAdd a third \" Feedback\" category (hopefully VRChat can count to 3 unlike Valve).\n\nThis would allow for better distinction between actual big feature requests and tiny feedback posts that could *relatively easily* be implemented.",
